      },
      "title": "Essential Ocean Variables",
      "description": "GOOS Essential Ocean Variables present in the dataset. Deprecated values remain valid structurally but block submission.",
      "x-cioos-tab": "dataID",
      "x-cioos-error": {
        "en": "At least one EOV is required",
